    },
    "source": [
      "# Python I Module: Solving Initial Value Problems with solve_ivp\n",
      "\n",
      "## Why Are We Learning This?\n",
      "Many chemical reactor design problems cannot be solved analytically. Examples include some PFR and batch reactor design problems, many non-isothermal reactor problems, and most problems i[...]",
      "\n",
      "The goal of this module is to learn a workflow that can be applied throughout the remainder of the course."
    ],
    "id": "4InVOPlmFMuq"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {
      "id": "cprXVvypFMus"
    },
    "source": [
      "## Learning Objectives\n",
      "- Review the use of solve_ivp from CBE 2345\n",
      "- Write a system of ODEs\n",
      "- Create a Python function representing the ODEs\n",
      "- Solve an IVP using solve_ivp\n",
      "- Extract results from the solution object\n",
      "- Plot results using Matplotlib\n",
      "- Interpret numerical solutions"
    ],
    "id": "cprXVvypFMus"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "Let's start by reviewing solve_ivp. We can apply this to the the series reactions A → B → C with elementary kinetics."
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "id": "Auji4HDqFwjj"
    },
    "id": "Auji4HDqFwjj"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": null,
    "metadata": {
      "id": "LXLe19XnFMus"
    },
    "outputs": [],
    "source": [
      "import numpy as np\n",
      "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
      "from scipy.integrate import solve_ivp"
    ],
    "id": "LXLe19XnFMus"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {
      "id": "KuSK20kNFMut"
    },
    "source": [
      "## Step 1: Define Parameters and ODEs\n",
      "\n",
      "Let's carry these reactions out in the liquid phase in a beaker (e.g., a bench top sized batch reactor). The rate constants k1 and k2 are 0.50 and 0.20 hr^-1. The reaction can be assumed [...]")
    ],
    "id": "KuSK20kNFMut"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": null,
    "metadata": {
      "id": "Hz-mRY1mFMut"
    },
    "outputs": [],
    "source": [
      "k1 = 0.50  # 1/hr\n",
      "k2 = 0.20  # 1/hr\n",
      "\n",
      "def reactor_odes(t, C):\n",
      "    CA, CB, CC = C\n",
      "\n",
      "    dCAdt = -k1 * CA\n",
      "    dCBdt = k1 * CA - k2 * CB\n",
      "    dCCdt = k2 * CB\n",
      "\n",
      "    return [dCAdt, dCBdt, dCCdt]"
    ],
    "id": "Hz-mRY1mFMut"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {
      "id": "sYN9kxa4FMuu"
    },
    "source": [
      "## Step 2: Define Initial Conditions\n",
      "\n",
      "Let's carry out the reaction for initial conditions of CA, CB, and CC of 2.0 M, 0.0 M, and 0.0 M, respectively."
    ],
    "id": "sYN9kxa4FMuu"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": null,
    "metadata": {
      "id": "jlL3i-KAFMuu"
    },
    "outputs": [],
    "source": [
      "C0 = [2.0, 0.0, 0.0]"
    ],
    "id": "jlL3i-KAFMuu"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {
      "id": "jhyrLnSsFMuv"
    },
    "source": [
      "## Step 3: Define Time Span\n",
      "\n",
      "This is really up to you. Over what time interval do you want to observe the predicted concentrations?"
    ],
    "id": "jhyrLnSsFMuv"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": null,
    "metadata": {
      "id": "ravYfOGQFMuv"
    },
    "outputs": [],
    "source": [
      "t_start = 0\n",
      "t_end = 15\n",
      "t_eval = np.linspace(t_start, t_end, 200)"
    ],
    "id": "ravYfOGQFMuv"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {
      "id": "En27XdiCFMuv"
    },
    "source": [
      "## Step 4: Solve the ODE System"
    ],
    "id": "En27XdiCFMuv"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": null,
    "metadata": {
      "id": "3uDPII-dFMuw"
    },
    "outputs": [],
    "source": [
      "solution = solve_ivp(reactor_odes,[t_start, t_end],C0,t_eval=t_eval)"
    ],
    "id": "3uDPII-dFMuw"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {
      "id": "Xvkh54j1FMuw"
    },
    "source": [
      "## Step 5: Extract Results"
    ],
    "id": "Xvkh54j1FMuw"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": null,
    "metadata": {
      "id": "RSb7Wg5hFMuw"
    },
    "outputs": [],
    "source": [
      "t = solution.t\n",
      "CA = solution.y[0]\n",
      "CB = solution.y[1]\n",
      "CC = solution.y[2]"
    ],
    "id": "RSb7Wg5hFMuw"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {
      "id": "MglN3AXQFMuw"
    },
    "source": [
      "## Step 6: Plot the Results"
    ],
    "id": "MglN3AXQFMuw"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "execution_count": null,
    "metadata": {
      "colab": {
        "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
        "height": 465
      },
      "id": "La-jS8WyFMuw",
      "outputId": "2628ec76-306e-4bb5-8fba-46c7b021eab2"
    },
    "outputs": [
      {
        "output_type": "display_data",
        "data": {
          "text/plain": [
            "<Figure size 800x500 with 1 Axes>"
          ],
