        },
        "metadata": {}
      }
    ],
    "source": [
      "plt.figure(figsize=(8,5))\n",
      "plt.plot(t, CA, label=\"CA\")\n",
      "plt.plot(t, CB, label=\"CB\")\n",
      "plt.plot(t, CC, label=\"CC\")\n",
      "plt.xlabel(\"Time (hr)\")\n",
      "plt.ylabel(\"Concentration (mol/L)\")\n",
      "plt.legend()\n",
      "plt.grid()\n",
      "plt.show()"
    ],
    "id": "La-jS8WyFMuw"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {
      "id": "buJENG8lFMuw"
    },
    "source": [
      "## Interpreting the Results\n",
      "- CA should decrease with time.\n",
      "- CC should increase with time.\n",
      "- CB should rise, reach a maximum, and then decrease."
    ],
    "id": "buJENG8lFMuw"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "metadata": {
      "id": "dfSOLCVvFMuw"
    },
    "source": [
      "## Common Student Errors\n",
      "1. Using `def reactor_odes(C,t)` instead of `def reactor_odes(t,C)` for solve_ivp.\n",
      "2. Forgetting to specify initial conditions.\n",
      "3. Plotting the solution object rather than its contents.\n",
      "4. Returning the wrong number of differential equations.\n",
