  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "# Now let's apply solve_ivp to the \"Fogler P10-12\" in class activity"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "id": "6jxmpw1PH-Ot"
    },
    "id": "6jxmpw1PH-Ot"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "## Problem statement\n",
      "\n",
      "The gas-phase reaction 2A -> B is carried out over a catalyst in a PFR.\n",
      "\n",
      "Rate law:\n",
      "\n",
      "$\\$-r_A = \\frac{k_{PA}^2}{(1 + K_AP_A + K_BP_B)^2}\\$\n",
      "\n",
      "Parameters: $$k = 1250, K_A = 4, K_B = 13$$\n",
      "\n",
      "Feed conditions: FA0 = 2 mol/s, PA0 = 2 atm, pure A feed.\n",
      "\n",
      "## Step 1: Write the Mole Balance\n",
      "\n",
      "For a PFR:\n",
      "\n",
      "$\\$\\frac{dX}{dV} = \\frac{-r_A}{F_{A0}}\\$\n",
      "\n",
      "## Step 2: Partial Pressures as Functions of Conversion\n",
      "\n",
      "$\\$P_A = \\frac{P_{A0}(1-X)}{1-\\frac{X}{2}}\\$\n",
      "\n",
      "$\\$P_B = \\frac{0.5P_{A0}X}{1-\\frac{X}{2}}\\$"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "id": "y9yDITNsImsX"
    },
    "id": "y9yDITNsImsX"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "from scipy.integrate import solve_ivp\n",
      "from scipy.optimize import root_scalar"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "id": "ms4tSvC2Jm5r"
    },
    "id": "ms4tSvC2Jm5r",
    "execution_count": null,
    "outputs": []
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "k = 1250\n",
      "KA = 4\n",
      "KB = 13\n",
      "FA0 = 2\n",
      "PA0 = 2"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "id": "Cfnid9JBJzJH"
    },
    "id": "Cfnid9JBJzJH",
    "execution_count": null,
    "outputs": []
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "def rate(X):\n",
      "    PA = PA0*(1-X)/(1-X/2)\n",
      "    PB = 0.5*PA0*X/(1-X/2)\n",
      "    rA = -k*PA**2/(1 + KA*PA + KB*PB)**2\n",
      "    return rA\n",
      "\n",
      "def pfr_ode(V,y):\n",
      "    X = y[0]\n",
      "    return [(-rate(X))/FA0]"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "id": "-GGT4ia5JvRI"
    },
    "id": "-GGT4ia5JvRI",
    "execution_count": null,
    "outputs": []
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "## Example 1: Conversion in a 2-L PFR"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "id": "f4okuHN6KEeF"
    },
    "id": "f4okuHN6KEeF"
  },
  {
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "sol = solve_ivp(pfr_ode,[0,2],[0],t_eval=np.linspace(0,2,200))\n",
      "X_final = sol.y[0,-1]\n",
      "print(\"Conversion at 2 L =\", X_final)"
    ],
    "metadata": {
